Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主啊 我要赞颂你的圣名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give glory to thee O Lord: for you have saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.87,0:02:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拯救我于不公 毁谤与不公的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}from injustice, from slanderous tongues and an unjust king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将始终颂赞你 直至生命最后一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}My soul shall praise thee even to the last to my death,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为你救赎那些等待您降临的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for thou deliveries those that wait for thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ENOUGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭迎公主殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way for Princess Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为公主让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way for her Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 金斯顿大人 - 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Master Kingston. - My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我现在向您宣布国王的裁决\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady, I can now tell you that the King has decreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您将被处以斩首之刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you will not be burned,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}免受火刑之苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but suffer a quicker death by decapitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下仁慈 恩准了您的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his mercy, the King has also acceded to your plea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交由加来的刽子手执行斩首\N{\fnArial\fs30}to use the services of the Executioner of Calais,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:06:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前他正从多佛赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is even now on his way here from Dover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 何时执行 - 上午九时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When am I to die? - At nine o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我别无他求了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am content.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可否请克朗默大主教前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please send for Archbishop Cranmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聆听我的临终忏悔 施行临终圣体\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he may hear my last confession and administer Holy Communion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝贤侄收鉴\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To the Emperor. Nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想必此消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This day will bring you, I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚合君意\N{\fnArial\fs30}"news of great satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我二人当冰释前嫌\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let us put all quarrels behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共同促进两国间贸易\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And work for an accommodation that will increase the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共同繁荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and prosperity between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结盟对抗法王鼠辈\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And unite us against that bastard, the King of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对变化所带来的希望尤为喜悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Above all, I love the prospect of change."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金斯顿大人 夫人近况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Kingston, tell me, how is the Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕在下直言 在她囚禁初期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truthfully, in the early days of her captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}言语甚为放肆\N{\fnArial\fs30}she often spoke rather wildly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}例如 除非将她释放 否则天将大旱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, that it would not rain until she was released.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近来她的施赈吏上报\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, according to her almoner,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的赴死之念渐炽\N{\fnArial\fs30}preparations for death have increasingly occupied her thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我认为她将甘心受刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so I believe she is reconciled to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我甚感欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我却不得不加重她的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}it grieves me that I must cause her further pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我不得已相告\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady, I am obliged to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您与国王的婚姻已经被宣布无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your marriage to the King has been declared null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what grounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基于发现您的至亲左近曾与国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the grounds of your close and forbidden degree of affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生肌肤之亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}to another woman known carnally by the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妹妹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那么我女儿是… ？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then my daughter is…? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白将被宣布为私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth is to be declared a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我向你发誓 我将倾尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, I swear to you I will do everything within my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保护和拥护她 留住国王对她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect and support her, and keep her always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仁慈与怜爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the King's good and kind graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的大限将至\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, since my time approaches,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恳请主教大人聆听我的忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your Grace to hear my confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时 我希望在接受主时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, I should like the Constable present.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警役可以在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I receive the good Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的孩子 你有忏悔之意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My child, do you have a confession?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在上帝面前发誓 我是清白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess my innocence before God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我庄严发誓 以我的灵魂起誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I solemnly swear, on the damnation of my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未对我夫君不忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have never been unfaithful to my lord and husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亦从未有过任何肉体背叛行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor ever offended with my body against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.07,0:09:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并非说我一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not say that I have always borne towards him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对他谦卑贤淑\N{\fnArial\fs30}the humility which I owed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于他的仁慈 赐予我的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering his kindness and the great honor he showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及给予我莫大的尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the great respect he always paid me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我承认自己时常对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admit, too, that I have often taken it into my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心存妒嫉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be jealous of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但此心可鉴 上帝作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But God knows, and is my witness,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再无任何其他方式违犯于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not sinned against him in any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}切勿以为我这样说是为了苟活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think not I say this in the hope to prolong my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝已教会我如何面对死亡 坚定我的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}God has taught me how to die, and He will strengthen my faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for my brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及那些受到不公正的罪罚的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those others who were unjustly condemned,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我甘领数死以拯救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would willingly have suffered many deaths to deliver them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.43,0:10:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然陛下乐于如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but since I see it pleases the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我便甘愿与他们一同赴死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will willingly accompany them in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this assurance…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将与他们一起获得安宁之永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I shall lead an endless life with them in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以圣父 圣子 圣灵的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the name of the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金斯顿大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Kingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请务必记录下夫人诚恳的临终忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please go and make sure to report my Lady's true and last confession,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以便世人了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the world will know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克朗默阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cranmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是最后的时刻 我也未曾想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not suppose that, even at this last hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让福音派的主教替我斡旋\N{\fnArial\fs30}the evangelical bishops that we put in place might intervene for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.03,0:11:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们怎么会呢？请见谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could they? Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们要靠主常常喜乐 永永远远 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaudeamus omnes in Domino, per omnia saecula saeculorum. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结束了吗 那个人尽可夫的女人死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it done? Is the harlot dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不甚了解 但她离死期不远矣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. But, certainly, she will be dead before very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苍天有眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说说她被判死刑的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me: why is she really to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说她的女儿 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that her child, Elizabeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非国王的骨肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}was not conceived with the King at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是与她其中一个情人所生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with one of her countless lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她大概有多少情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many lovers was she supposed to have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:13:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据克伦威尔阁下声称 有一百余人\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Mr. Cromwell, over a hundred men,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中包括她弟弟 洛克福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}including her brother, Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听闻她将自己所遭受的厄运全都归咎于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm told she also blames me for what has befallen her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}指责我对此负有不可推卸的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}and holds me accountable for her doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自然是对这种「恭维」感到「欣喜」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally I am flattered by the compliment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为她早想把我喂狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since she would have thrown me to the dogs if she could.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位珍·西摩女士如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about this other Lady, this Jane Seymour?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有密报说她支持我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been told in confidence that she is of our faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王爱她 欲娶她为妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that the King loves her, and means to marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且她有意谏言恢复殿下的继承权\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that she means to restore your grace to the succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白如今也成了私生子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Elizabeth will become a bastard now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如当年宣布我为私生子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I have been a bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现已正式宣布这个乳臭未干的小孩为私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brat is now officially a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}命人备马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to ready the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但去向保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tell no one of our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凡事皆有定期\N{\fnArial\fs30}To every thing there is a season,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天下万务皆有定时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a time to every purpose under heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生有时 死有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to be born, and a time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}栽种有时 拔出所栽种的 也有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to plant and a time to pluck up that which is planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哭有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to weep,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}笑有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a time to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抛掷石头有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to cast away stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}堆聚石头有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a time to gather stones together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哀恸有时 跳舞有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to mourn, and a time to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现今的事早先就有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That which hath been is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.25,0:15:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经来的事也早已有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that which is to be has already been…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寻梢有时 失落有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to get, and a time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保守有时 舍弃有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to keep, and a time to cast away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撕裂有时 缝补有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to rend, and a time to sew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}静默有时 言语有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time to keep silence, and a time to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我心里说 神必审判义人和恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said in my heart, God shall judge the righteous and the wicked,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为在那里 天下万务皆有定时\N{\fnArial\fs30}for there is a time for every purpose under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在就要出发吗 我还以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to go now? I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady, forgive me…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从多佛来的刽子手在路上耽搁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The executioner has been delayed on the road from Dover.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.21,0:16:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以您的行刑将延时至十二点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your execution is postponed until twelve o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想及时告诉你 以防万一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to tell you, in good time, in case…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金斯顿大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Kingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是说正午之前我都不会死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you say I will not die before noon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sorry for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为那时候我就死了 解脱痛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I thought to be dead by that time, and past my pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 不会疼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, there will be no pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎感觉不到挥剑而下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blow will be so subtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 听说那个刽子手技法精湛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I heard the executioner was very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么说 我的脖子很细\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in any case, I have only a little neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.51,0:17:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.93,0:17:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.30,0:17:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华 这可不是玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward, this is not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.93,0:17:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 您杀过人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, have you ever killed someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有 在战场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. In battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.88,0:18:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么样的感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did it feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我根本不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很想看看人死的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would really like to see someone die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能和您一起去刑场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I go to the execution with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个断头台他们要价多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much did they charge for the scaffold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.61,0:18:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}23英磅6先令8便士 大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-three pounds, six shillings and eight pence, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}光天化日下抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daylight robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.39,0:18:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那个刽子手能赶到的话 要付他多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is the Headsman to be paid, if he ever arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}15英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}15英镑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen pounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就那么一刀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one stroke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天 他的活可太好赚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, he makes a damn good living!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 继续往前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allons, vas-y. Allons-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到那里去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}On y va. Viens!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.58,0:19:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经斩首了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结束了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有陛下 非常不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, your Majesty. Uh… Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们又要延迟行刑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must postpone the execution again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么？- 刽子手还没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The Executioner was delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.41,0:19:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就再找一个 听见了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you fetch somebody else! Do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把那个给其他人行刑的刽子手找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch back the axman who did the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他够好了吧？没搞砸过事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was good enough wasn't he? He didn't botch the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可陛下您承诺过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为什么要遵守对那个妓女的承诺？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I care about my promises to that whore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的承诺业已昭告天下 那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty's promise is public knowledge. That is all…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我命令你另找一人 我要她死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ordered you to get someone else! I want her dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it over with! Finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不想和她一样 就照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and do it or by God's blood you will join her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.81,0:20:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}延时执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Postpone it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金斯顿大人 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Kingston, I am ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我再次请求您的宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady, you must forgive me once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刽子手仍未到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Executioner is still not arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 您的行刑将改在明日上午九时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, your execution is put off until nine o'clock tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是说我想死 只是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not that I desire death, but I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做好了赴死的准备 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought myself prepared to die… I was prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怕一再的延迟会动摇我的决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear that of further delay it may weaken my resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.05,0:21:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你 如果… 如果可能的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please… If it… If it were possible…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.48,0:21:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 夫人 这是国王陛下的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Madam. It is the King's express command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.39,0:22:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 可能这意味着我命不该绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Wait! Perhaps I'm not meant to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一再改期一定意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}These postponements they mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能国王陛下是在试探我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the King is testing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会被送到女修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be sent to a nunnery.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.96,0:23:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰爵士 想必你已得知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure you are aware, Sir John,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.25,0:23:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的婚姻已被宣布无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my marriage has been declared null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已有所耳闻 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been made aware of the circumstances, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.11,0:23:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, like everyone else, I have been shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对此也感到十分震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and utterly amazed by what I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多劳挂怀 但我必须要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am grateful. But I must tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管已屡次受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Privy Council, despite these recent hurts,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}枢密院恳请我再尝试一次婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}have pleaded with me to venture once more into matrimony,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并希望新娘能为我诞下合法的继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the hope that my bride will produce a legitimate heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.72,0:23:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想必您也知道我选择了令嫒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know my choice has fallen upon your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.69,0:23:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明日你们将乘游船前往汉普顿宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you will all travel by barge to Hampton Court,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.31,0:23:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将在那儿宣布订婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}where our betrothal will be announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.95,0:24:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您发誓 约翰爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to you, Sir John,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.64,0:24:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从明天起 一切将焕然一新\N{\fnArial\fs30}from tomorrow, everything will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.64,0:24:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将如往昔般充满活力 神怿气愉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will be young and merry as we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.91,0:24:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 敬珍女士 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Jane. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敬珍女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Jane!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.93,0:24:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想穿 你不能强迫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't wear it! You can't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.64,0:24:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要不要 我不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! I'm not going!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.97,0:24:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白小姐 你必须照做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Elizabeth, you must do as you are told!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.77,0:24:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安静 否则我要打你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hush! Or I will hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.34,0:24:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这样看我 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look like that, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.18,0:24:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们奉命将孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are ordered to remove the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转移到国王视线以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she can be kept out of sight of the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 小公主 - 她已经不是公主了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Little Princess. - She is no longer a Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.61,0:24:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.29,0:24:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人还要求把她的账目理清\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Master Cromwell has asked for her accounts to be settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.83,0:24:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包括为她母亲在伦敦塔中提供的必需品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also in respect of necessities provided for her mother in the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.48,0:25:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说 要她承担她母亲关押时的费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, the child should pay for her mother's imprisonment?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 从国王提供的生活费中扣除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Out of the money the King pays for her household.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.46,0:25:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个复杂多变的世界 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is a slippery place, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.42,0:25:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你肯听我一言\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would take my advice, for what it's worth,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.74,0:25:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找个有钱人嫁了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}find a rich man to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.05,0:25:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要是个对政治一窍不通的笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is too stupid to know anything about politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.30,0:25:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后除非你死于难产 有这个可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, perhaps, unless you die in childbirth, which is likely,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.17,0:25:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是在不可避免的瘟疫中丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the plague, which is almost inevitable…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你将会很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you will be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.19,0:25:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想聊些什么呢 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like to talk about, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果陛下不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your Majesty would allow,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.36,0:25:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想谈谈您的女儿玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to talk about your daughter Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.65,0:25:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望我当王后时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I am Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.30,0:25:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能看到她重获继承权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hope to see her reinstated as heir apparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.51,0:25:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍 就你这个小傻瓜才会这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, you're a fool to hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.24,0:26:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该为我们将来的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to solicit the advancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.91,0:26:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恳求这个权力 而不是其他人的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the children we're going to have, not any others.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是陛下 我这么做不是为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Your Majesty, I thought I was asking not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.67,0:26:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别人求好 而是为您的心境\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the good of others, as for the good of the repose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.65,0:26:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安详宁静着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tranquility of yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.52,0:26:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也为我们未来的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as the children we may have ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.01,0:26:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及陛下的王国太平\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the tranquility of your Majesty's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.89,0:26:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.52,0:26:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是太想要一个崭新的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that I so much want a new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.69,0:26:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一场复兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}A renaissance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.55,0:26:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时往事不堪提 你理解吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it is hard to be reminded of things. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.65,0:26:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是如此纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是不想让你被陈年往事困扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want you to be affected by things that have gone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.15,0:27:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以吻你吗 珍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I kiss you, Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.39,0:27:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是英格兰国王吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the King of England?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.47,0:27:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切将为她而改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything will change for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.25,0:27:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那吻是她的命运与财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kiss is her destiny, and her fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.86,0:27:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们亦然\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.86,0:27:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我还是小女孩时 我在奥地利的玛格丽特宫廷当差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I was a girl, I served at the court of Margaret of Austria.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.41,0:27:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾是多么美妙的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a wonderful time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.37,0:27:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}壮丽的场面和舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pageants and dances.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.90,0:27:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多很多的舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many dances.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.71,0:27:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有次我曾经扮作亚马逊人的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once appeared as the Queen of the Amazons,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.09,0:27:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手里舞着剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a naked sword in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.11,0:27:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戴着绯红的头饰和巨大的羽毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a crimson headdress with a great plume!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.94,0:27:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛格丽特也同样聪颖智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Margaret was wise, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.37,0:28:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她告诫我们：「要信任那些服侍你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said to us: "Trust in those who offer you service,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.62,0:28:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「少女们 因为你们将发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and in the end, my maidens, you will find yourself in the ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.10,0:28:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最终会被那些头衔显赫的人所欺骗「\N{\fnArial\fs30}of those who have been deceived."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.75,0:28:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.54,0:28:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将被审讯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to be tried?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.47,0:28:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你将被释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You are to be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.21,0:28:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 陛下谕令如下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, his Majesty commands,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.93,0:29:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于你不再受宠信\N{\fnArial\fs30}that since you no longer enjoy his trust or affection,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.94,0:29:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将立即褫夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are to be stripped forthwith.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你所有的官职与头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all your official posts and titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.82,0:29:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你将不再任职于枢密院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will no longer serve on the Privy Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.24,0:29:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再担任掌玺大臣一职\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will relinquish the role of Lord Privy Seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.48,0:29:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}及其所有特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all its privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.59,0:29:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下也要求你立即离宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty also desires that you leave court.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远离开陛下的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that you never show yourself in his presence again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}违者以死论处\N{\fnArial\fs30}On pain of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.58,0:29:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说我将保留我的伯爵身份？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I am to keep my earldom?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.78,0:29:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否看过你儿子被处死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you watch your son die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.94,0:29:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的女儿又如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.32,0:29:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否会看她受刑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you watch her suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.16,0:29:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否会看她受死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you watch her die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.42,0:29:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 波林 这一切值得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Boleyn: was it all worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.52,0:30:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:31:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.06,0:31:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道这是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.34,0:31:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是青春之泉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.81,0:31:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.78,0:32:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已获重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am re-born!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.85,0:32:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边请 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.71,0:32:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉有所耽搁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deeply regret you were delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.71,0:32:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可否观赏一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.78,0:32:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请随意 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si vous voulez, Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.03,0:32:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很漂亮 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.54,0:32:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行刑时间为九时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The execution is ordered for nine o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.27,0:32:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您将在二个小时前被叫醒 以便您能食用早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be awoken two hours before, in order for you to have breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.99,0:32:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 此外还有别的事情吗？- 是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, if that is all? - No, Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.51,0:32:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有几句话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.51,0:32:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人绝对不能带任何镣铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lady must not to be restrained in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.70,0:33:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且 对夫人非常重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, it is very important that the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.90,0:33:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能回头观看从而会对此剑产生恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't look back like this for the fear of the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.61,0:33:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以首先 我会把剑掩藏到她看不见的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alors first, I hide the sword so she cannot see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.10,0:33:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通常他们都会四处观望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is totally normal they want to look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.07,0:33:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想看看死亡来自何方 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see where your death come from. No? Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.46,0:33:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 当她完成祷告准备赴死时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when she has finished her prayers, and is ready to go…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.12,0:33:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会对在她前面男孩说「取我的剑来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say, to boy in front of her, "Fetch my sword".
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.05,0:33:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然夫人会注视那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course the lady looks at man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.86,0:33:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这便是对我最完美的角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is just the perfect angle for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.02,0:33:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在她注视那人时 我便猛然挥剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she looks at man. Then I strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.37,0:33:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后「喀嚓」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, "Chuck!"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.00,0:33:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.26,0:33:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.23,0:33:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常快 她不会感觉任何痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's very quick. She feel no pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.01,0:33:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.66,0:33:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您将不会失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be not disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.98,0:33:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.33,0:34:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您知无论我是否该当一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thou knowest whether I deserve this death.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.80,0:34:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要成就我的意思 只要成就你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my will O Lord, but thine be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.64,0:34:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将赞美上主的名号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give glory to thy name,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.46,0:34:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因你赐我帮助与庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}for thou art my help and my protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.22,0:34:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已庇护我 保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thou hast protected me and preserved me…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.27,0:34:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.47,0:35:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.69,0:35:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.59,0:35:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.83,0:36:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 时辰已到 请务必备妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, the hour approaches, you must make ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必过虑您的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acquit yourself of your charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.70,0:36:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我早已备妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I have been long prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.66,0:37:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王请您带着这个钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King asks that you take this purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.79,0:37:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面有二十镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has twenty pounds in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.74,0:37:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用来支付刽子手的服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pay the headsman for his services.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.92,0:37:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及布施贫寒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and distribute alms to the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.77,0:37:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.61,0:37:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您与您的侍女们随我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you and your ladies follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.07,0:39:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金斯顿大人 我请求您直到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Kingston, I pray you not to give the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.59,0:40:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把心中的话讲完 再发行刑信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my death until I have spoken what I have the mind to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.93,0:40:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.21,0:40:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虔诚的信徒子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Christian people,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.24,0:40:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我依法来此受死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come here to die, according to the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.58,0:40:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来服从吾王 我的夫君的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}and thus yield myself to the will of the King, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.20,0:40:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.41,0:40:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果在有生之年有触犯龙颜之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if, in my life, I ever did offend the King's Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.71,0:40:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我现以一死来偿还\N{\fnArial\fs30}then surely with my death I do now atone…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.41,0:40:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我祈祷并且祈求所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray and beseech you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.27,0:40:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为吾王祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pray for the life of the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.49,0:41:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天佑吾王\N{\fnArial\fs30}God save the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.63,0:41:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我与你们至高无上的君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sovereign lord and yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.32,0:41:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乃芸芸众生中之最佳王公\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is one of the best princes on the face of the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.62,0:41:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他总是待我慈善有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has always treated me so well,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.06,0:41:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我衷心赴死\N{\fnArial\fs30}wherefore I submit to death with a good will,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.35,0:41:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并谦卑请求所有世人宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}humbly asking pardon of all the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.59,0:41:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如有人谈论我的事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone should take up my case,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.81,0:41:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我谨请求他们只以善意来评判\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask them only to judge it kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.98,0:42:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you… Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.18,0:42:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 原谅我必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame, forgive me for what I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.70,0:42:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乐意之极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.69,0:42:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是给你的报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here is your purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.51,0:43:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我将辞别世间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus I take my leave of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.19,0:43:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 辞别你们 - 保佑您…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and of you. - Bless you…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.99,0:43:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且我热诚渴望你们为我祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I heartily desire you all to pray for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.40,0:43:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求主怜悯您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord have mercy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.08,0:43:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主是我的牧者 我必不至缺乏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord is my shepherd. I shall not be in want.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.06,0:43:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他使我躺卧在青草地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes me lie down in green pastures.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.14,0:43:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}领我在可安歇的水边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He leads me beside quiet waters…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.60,0:43:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耶稣 接受我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, receive my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.81,0:43:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主 怜悯我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}O Lord God, have pity on my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.90,0:43:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我的灵魂托付给基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Christ I commend my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.92,0:43:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耶稣基督接受我的灵魂 主 怜悯我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ receive my soul! O Lord God have pity on my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.80,0:43:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耶稣 接受我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus receive my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.70,0:43:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主 怜悯我的灵魂 耶稣基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}O God have pity on my soul, Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.27,0:43:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主 怜悯我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}O Lord God have pity on my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.86,0:43:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耶稣 接受我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ receive my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.15,0:44:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.05,0:44:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耶稣 接受我的灵魂 耶稣基督接受我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ receive my soul. Jesus Christ receive my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.38,0:44:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主 怜悯我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}O Lord God have pity on my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.61,0:44:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我的灵魂托付给基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Christ I commend myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.71,0:44:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耶稣 接受我的灵魂 主 怜悯我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus receive my soul. O Lord God have pity on my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.88,0:44:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我的灵魂托付给基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Christ I commend myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.45,0:44:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我的灵魂托付给基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Christ I commend myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.97,0:44:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}少年 拿我的剑来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy! Fetch my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.06,0:45:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为国王御用让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way for the King's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.21,0:45:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.60,0:45:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为国王御用让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way for the King's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.24,0:46:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝愿主耶稣赐予饮食\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Lord Jesus be drink and food.
